## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/turingpatterns.html
- Summary (EN): Creates stripe and spot patterns from an input by alternating blur and sharpen passes over several iterations, so the patterns follow the form of the original input. It is meant for organic patterns without a complex simulation, unlike the Reaction-Diffusion nodes. Output is pattern. Available since Houdini 22.0.
- Résumé (FR) : Ce nœud crée des motifs de rayures et de taches en alternant flou et netteté sur plusieurs itérations, sans simulation complexe, à partir de la forme de l'image source.

- Inputs meaning: ["source: the layer or VDB the filter is applied to.", "radius: optional per-pixel layer or VDB that scales the blur amount.", "mask: optional per-pixel mask that scales the Mask parameter."]

